{"classification":"source-duplicate-word","correction_applied":true,"id":"O007-CORR-0236","provenance":{"basis":"exact current source-correction ledger row","kind":"source-correction-ledger","source_resource_ids":["O007-RESOURCE-CH25-COMPLETE-SOURCE-CORRECTIONS"]},"rationale":"The second line-opening 'of' duplicates the preposition at the end of the preceding line; the derivative removes the duplicate while translating the sentence.","record_type":"source_correction","rights_id":"O007-RIGHTS-FREMLIN-DSL","schema_version":"1.1.0","source_locator":"authority/fremlin/source/mt2.2016/mt256.tex:789-790","source_text":"a linear combination of / of Radon-Nikod\\'ym derivatives","target_locator":"source/id-ID/mt256.tex:797-798","target_text":"suatu kombinasi linear dari turunan-turunan Radon-Nikod\\'ym","unit_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S256"}
{"classification":"mathematical-missing-outer-measure-star","correction_applied":true,"id":"O007-CORR-0237","math_ordinal":742,"provenance":{"basis":"exact current source-correction ledger row","kind":"source-correction-ledger","source_resource_ids":["O007-RESOURCE-CH25-COMPLETE-SOURCE-CORRECTIONS"]},"rationale":"The exercise introduces the corresponding outer measure and quantifies over every subset A; nu(A) need not be defined for a nonmeasurable A, whereas nu-star(A) is.","record_type":"source_correction","rights_id":"O007-RIGHTS-FREMLIN-DSL","schema_version":"1.1.0","source_locator":"authority/fremlin/source/mt2.2016/mt256.tex:824","source_normalized_sha256":"18423d7681c7daf31844e32ca5302c430c3eef0b10fff399c904c14447dec842","source_text":"$\\nu A=\\inf\\{\\nu G:G\\supseteq A$ is open$\\}$","target_locator":"source/id-ID/mt256.tex:833","target_normalized_sha256":"a7532729ad649907317dd1757d9d5132fac07437b74340fcfaf6a3ef4be5b759","target_text":"$\\nu^*A=\\inf\\{\\nu G:G\\supseteq A$ terbuka$\\}$","unit_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S256"}
{"classification":"mathematical-wrong-bound-variable","correction_applied":true,"id":"O007-CORR-0238","math_ordinal":844,"provenance":{"basis":"exact current source-correction ledger row","kind":"source-correction-ledger","source_resource_ids":["O007-RESOURCE-CH25-COMPLETE-SOURCE-CORRECTIONS"]},"rationale":"The defining formula binds coordinate i; j occurs nowhere in the formula and leaves i unquantified.","record_type":"source_correction","rights_id":"O007-RIGHTS-FREMLIN-DSL","schema_version":"1.1.0","source_locator":"authority/fremlin/source/mt2.2016/mt256.tex:894","source_normalized_sha256":"4bbaaa4bfb787daebc9ff15877b939a9e6b56801e1798e965982935af3cd6666","source_text":"$\\psi(x)(i)=x(i+1)$ for $x\\in\\{0,1\\}^{\\Bbb N}$ and $j\\in\\Bbb N$","target_locator":"source/id-ID/mt256.tex:904-905","target_normalized_sha256":"9f0a6a15304d49b2ef292531e7fb2f2f28a8aa6ff74fcacf8e3bcb59a8c19f08","target_text":"$\\psi(x)(i)=x(i+1)$ untuk $x\\in\\{0,1\\}^{\\Bbb N}$ dan $i\\in\\Bbb N$","unit_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S256"}
